sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant SPA as Web app (React)
  participant API as API server (FastAPI)
  participant Auth as Auth0
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant Mail as Email service
  User->>SPA: Open app
  SPA->>Auth: Redirect to login
  Auth-->>SPA: Authorization code
  SPA->>API: Exchange code
  API->>Auth: Verify code, get tokens
  Auth-->>API: ID + access tokens
  API->>DB: Upsert user
  API-->>SPA: Session cookie
  SPA->>API: Create report
  API->>DB: Save report
  API->>Mail: Queue summary email
  Mail-->>User: Weekly summary
